WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-03 - Safe Person
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Our Own Frequency (2008)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.154
[Instrumental Intro — Gentle Solitary Piano & Soft Acoustic Guitar]

00:00:14.154 --> 00:00:20.500
The cameras flash, the questions start to blur

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.181
I smile and nod, playing the character

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:34.745
But underneath the makeup and the lights

00:00:34.825 --> 00:00:41.009
I'm terrifyingly alone on these high wire nights

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:48.249
Until I catch your eye across the room

00:00:50.892 --> 00:00:55.758
And suddenly I'm safe inside this tomb

00:00:59.002 --> 00:01:02.800
You never have to wear the mask for me

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:06.941
I know exactly who you want to be

00:01:07.021 --> 00:01:10.500
When the oxygen gets thin up on the stage

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.000
I'll be the one to open up the cage

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.200
Just breathe and let the heavy armor fall

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:28.500
I've got you when your back is to the wall

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.800
You're the only one who sees me clear

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:41.500
When everything I am begins to disappear

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:46.800
And you're the melody I've always known

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:51.665
I'll never let you face the dark alone

00:01:55.767 --> 00:02:02.000
You're my safe person, the calm inside the storm

00:02:03.426 --> 00:02:11.000
The only place I know where I am warm

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:16.471
We tear down all the idols and the lies

00:02:16.551 --> 00:02:20.573
And find the truth inside each other's eyes

00:02:20.713 --> 00:02:24.200
No electric amps, no flashing lights

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:29.500
Just you and me surviving all the nights

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:36.443
You're my safe person...

00:02:37.845 --> 00:02:40.000
Always.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:07.000
[Outro — Gentle Vocal Humming, Piano & Resonating Acoustic Guitar Chord]
